    "_postman_id": "f8e7d6c5-b4a3-2918-7654-3210fedcba98",
    "name": "Atur Perjalanan API",
    "description": "REST API collection for Atur Perjalanan backend (NestJS).\n\n**Milestone coverage:** M3 — Health, Auth, Users | M4 — Trips & Invitations | M5 — Voting | M6 — Activities\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection and `atur-perjalanan-local.postman_environment.json`\n2. Select the **Atur Perjalanan — Local** environment\n3. Set `google_id_token` in the environment (from Google Sign-In on mobile/web)\n4. Run **Auth → Google Sign-In** — test script saves `access_token` automatically\n5. For new users, run **Complete Registration** before other authenticated requests\n\n## Two-user testing (invitations, voting)\nSome flows need two people at once (invite → accept, multi-voter tallies). This collection keeps **two independent sessions** so you never have to log out and back in:\n\n- **User 1** uses `access_token` (the default Bearer auth for every request).\n- **User 2** uses `access_token_2`. Requests suffixed **(User 2)** override their auth to use it.\n\nSteps:\n1. Set both `google_id_token` and `google_id_token_2` in the environment.\n2. Run **Auth → Google Sign-In** and **Auth → Google Sign-In (User 2)** — each saves its own token.\n3. (New users) run **Complete Registration** and **Complete Registration (User 2)**.\n4. Now use the normal requests as User 1 and the **(User 2)** variants as User 2, e.g.:\n   - Invite: **Invitations → Invite User** (User 1) → **Get My Invitations (User 2)** → **Accept Invitation (User 2)**.\n   - Voting: **Voting → Vote on Poll** (User 1) + **Vote on Poll (User 2)** to build a real tally.\n\n## Variables\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `base_url` | API base URL (default `http://localhost:8080/v1`) |\n| `google_id_token` / `google_id_token_2` | Google OAuth ID token for User 1 / User 2 |\n| `access_token` / `access_token_2` | App JWT for User 1 / User 2 (auto-saved after sign-in) |\n| `realtime_token` / `realtime_token_2` | Supabase-compatible JWT for Realtime (User 1 / User 2) |\n| `username` / `username_2` | Username for User 1 / User 2 |\n| `trip_id` | Trip ID for detail/invitation/member endpoints |\n| `invitation_id` | Invitation ID for respond/cancel endpoints |\n| `poll_id` / `option_id` / `candidate_id` | Voting IDs (copy real UUIDs from List Polls) |\n| `activity_id` | Activity ID for get/update/delete |\n| `member_id` | User ID of trip member to remove |\n| `document_id` | Document ID for setting cover |\n\n## Error format\n```json\n{ \"error\": { \"code\": \"ERROR_CODE\", \"message\": \"...\" }, \"requestId\": \"...\" }\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
